  "antiGuardianZoneResistance": {
    "description": "Anti-Guardian Zone Resistance carries no experimental effect, and on a Guardian module (power plant, power distributor, hull/module/shield reinforcement, FSD booster) it is the whole menu — so every group offering it offers no experimental effect, and the blueprint-level union is empty rather than the module family's list. The three Guardian weapon groups are the same: their menus are this recipe and nothing else. An ordinary weapon recipe on a Guardian weapon is always a pre-engineered purchase — in a 521-module capture every one of the 20 such weapons is a Fixed Small or Medium variant `pre-engineered.jsonc` records as sold carrying it, and the community corpus adds 13 more of the same shape — so an engineer will not roll one and no menu offers it. `modules` below names the six module families; the weapon groups are pinned in `groups`.",
    "blueprint": "GuardianModule_Sturdy",
    "experimentals": [],
    "groups": [
      "guardianPowerPlants",
      "guardianPowerDistributors",
      "guardianHullReinforcements",
      "fsdBoosters",
      "moduleReinforcements",
      "shieldReinforcements",
